  {
    id: 'gf6',
    title: '操场上的英语角',
    exam: '中考',
    mins: 7,
    text: 'Our school has an English corner on the playground. It started three years ago with six students, and now more than eighty of them join us ___1___ Wednesday afternoon. Nobody asks you to bring a textbook. The only rule is that you must speak English, even ___2___ you make mistakes. At first I was too shy to say anything and only listened to the others. Then a girl from Class 5 asked me ___3___ I liked to do after school, and I answered “basketball”. Since then I have come every week. Some students practise asking and answering questions, and others play word games with a small group of ___4___ (friend). Our English teacher, Ms. Chen, usually sits with us, but she never ___5___ (lead) the talk. Last term, Li Lei, one of the quietest boys in our class, spoke for three whole minutes about ___6___ bird. If you want a hobby that helps your English, come and try ___7___. You only need to be brave enough ___8___ open your mouth. The corner runs ___9___ April to June, and it is free. It is run by the students ___10___ (them), and that is why so many of us feel at home there.',
    answers: [
      { n: 1, answer: 'every', explain: '表示“每周三下午都来”，填 every 与一般现在时搭配。' },
      { n: 2, answer: 'if', explain: 'even if“即使”，引导让步状语从句。' },
      { n: 3, answer: 'what', explain: 'asked me 后的宾语从句中 do 缺宾语，用 what。' },
      { n: 4, answer: 'friends', give: 'friend', explain: 'a small group of 后接可数名词复数。' },
      { n: 5, answer: 'leads', give: 'lead', explain: '描述经常发生的事用一般现在时，主语 she 是第三人称单数。' },
      { n: 6, answer: 'his', explain: '与上文 Li Lei（男生）一致，用形容词性物主代词 his 修饰 bird。' },
      { n: 7, answer: 'it', explain: 'try it 指代上文的英语角活动，避免重复。' },
      { n: 8, answer: 'to', explain: 'be brave enough to do sth，enough 后接不定式。' },
      { n: 9, answer: 'from', explain: 'from April to June“从四月到六月”，与后面的 to 呼应。' },
      { n: 10, answer: 'themselves', give: 'them', explain: 'by oneself“由自己完成”，与主语 the students 一致，用反身代词。' },
    ],
