  {
    id: 'gf7',
    title: '社区的一桌晚饭',
    exam: '中考',
    mins: 7,
    text: 'Last Friday the people in my community spent the evening together under the moon. The street was cleaned ___1___ (careful) in the afternoon, and red lanterns were hung between the trees. Old people taught the children how to make mooncakes. First the flour and the water are mixed, and then the sweet bean paste ___2___ (put) inside the dough. My hands were covered with flour, and I made six cakes, none of ___3___ looked very good. A neighbour brought ___4___ erhu and played three old pieces. The music was soft, ___5___ everyone became quiet and listened. Children ran around the tables while their parents talked and laughed. In the past I thought these festivals were just an excuse to eat special food, but that evening changed my mind. Mrs. Gao, who is eighty-two, told us ___6___ story about the first community dinner forty years ago, when only five families ___7___ (come). Now the dinner has more than two hundred people. Before we left, she gave each child a small bag of cakes and asked us ___8___ (share) them with our neighbours. At nine in the evening the street was empty, but the lanterns were still ___9___ (light). If you want a festival that is not about shopping, look at ___10___ own street.',
    answers: [
      { n: 1, answer: 'carefully', give: 'careful', explain: '修饰 was cleaned 要用副词，形容词变副词加 -ly。' },
      { n: 2, answer: 'is put', give: 'put', explain: '说明制作步骤用一般现在时，bean paste 与 put 是被动关系。' },
      { n: 3, answer: 'which', explain: '非限制性定语从句，介词 of 之后只能用 which 指代前面的 cakes。' },
      { n: 4, answer: 'an', explain: 'erhu 读音以元音音素开头，用 an。' },
      { n: 5, answer: 'so', explain: '前因后果，“音乐柔和，所以大家安静下来听”，填连词 so。' },
      { n: 6, answer: 'a', explain: 'tell sb a story 泛指“一个故事”，story 以辅音音素开头。' },
      { n: 7, answer: 'came', give: 'come', explain: '与 forty years ago 一致，用一般过去时。' },
      { n: 8, answer: 'to share', give: 'share', explain: 'ask sb to do sth，用不定式作宾语补足语。' },
      { n: 9, answer: 'lit', give: 'light', explain: 'were 后接过去分词表示“仍亮着”，light 的过去分词是 lit。' },
      { n: 10, answer: 'your', explain: '与 own 搭配用形容词性物主代词，指“你自己住的那条街”。' },
